{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50398","headline":"十 · 王梵志","name":"十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"主人无床枕，坐旦捉㺃（郑本作「狗」。\n）狐。\n（「狐」，项楚校作「亲」。\n）莫学痛才汉，（「痛才汉」，伯三七一六、伯三六五六、伯三三九三卷作「庸才汉」，伯二八四二卷作「用庸汉」。\n）无事弃他门。\n（「弃他门」，伯三六五六卷作「去他门」，伯二八四二卷作「寻他朋」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50398.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50398","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}